# Optimizer provenance fact sheet

Each fact below was read from the cited page during this task (arXiv abstract pages, opened with a web-fetch tool or, for Adam, with curl). "Year first appeared" is the year of the first arXiv submission (v1).

| Optimizer | Introducing paper (title) | First author | Year first appeared | arXiv identifier |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Adam | Adam: A Method for Stochastic Optimization | Diederik P. Kingma (with Jimmy Ba) | 2014 (v1: 22 Dec 2014) | 1412.6980 |
| AdamW (decoupled weight decay) | Decoupled Weight Decay Regularization (v1 title: "Fixing Weight Decay Regularization in Adam") | Ilya Loshchilov (with Frank Hutter) | 2017 (v1: 14 Nov 2017) | 1711.05101 |
| Lion (EvoLved Sign Momentum) | Symbolic Discovery of Optimization Algorithms | Xiangning Chen (with 11 co-authors, last Quoc V. Le) | 2023 (v1: 13 Feb 2023) | 2302.06675 |

