## Notes

- The AdamW paper was retitled after v1; the current title is "Decoupled Weight Decay Regularization" (read at the first URL above), the v1 title is "Fixing Weight Decay Regularization in Adam" (read at the v1 URL).
- Adam's 2015 conference (ICLR) appearance is later than its 2014 arXiv v1; the sheet uses the first arXiv submission year.
- Tools: web fetch worked for arxiv.org; a direct `curl` to the arXiv API returned "unauthorized" and was not used.
